 "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15m1g.jpg"}, {"id": 1941461, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15m1h.jpg"}, {"id": 1941453, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15m19.jpg"}, {"id": 1941455, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15m1b.jpg"}], "slug": "hold-my-wheel", "storyline": "You and your idiot twin brothers need to visit grandma - never mind that the apocalypse hit the world ages ago. Your only home is the bus: grandma lovingly put collars on you all so you'd always stay together with your brothers and never leave the bus, because it can get dangerous out there.", "summary": "HOLD MY WHEEL is a 5-player online co-op action-adventure set in a post-apocalyptic wasteland. You and your idiot twin brothers must visit grandma, living in a bus you can never leave thanks to the collars she put on you. Keep the bus running, fire junk from its roof-mounted Scrap Cannon, lift, flip and throw it with a magnetic gun, and build bridges from scrap. Go hungry too long and you start eyeing your teammates; get bitten or irradiated and you turn into a zombie. Death is not the end: keep playing as a ghost, zombie or floppy ragdoll until a Hell-Kitty restores your human form.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hold-my-wheel", "videos": [{"id": 198003, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "m0PzcABs8X0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0PzcABs8X0", "title": "HOLD MY WHEEL - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m0PzcABs8X0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 198004, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HFCSVoccTIw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HFCSVoccTIw", "title": "HOLD MY WHEEL | Coop Post-Apocalyptic Chaos", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HFCSVoccTIw/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 198005, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WSTFj